<text x="770" y="998" font-family="Inter, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="11.5" font-weight="400" fill="#1d2330" text-anchor="start" >1. IOREF = 3,3 V: logica compatibel met Pi-GPIO</text>
<text x="770" y="1016" font-family="Inter, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="11.5" font-weight="400" fill="#1d2330" text-anchor="start" >    (Pi 5 GPIO is niet 5 V-tolerant).</text>
<text x="770" y="1034" font-family="Inter, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="11.5" font-weight="400" fill="#1d2330" text-anchor="start" >2. Gemeenschappelijke massa Pi (pin 6) ↔ gShield.</text>
<text x="770" y="1052" font-family="Inter, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="11.5" font-weight="400" fill="#1d2330" text-anchor="start" >3. Eindschakelaars schakelen naar GND;</text>
