<text x="770" y="1088" font-family="Inter, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="11.5" font-weight="400" fill="#1d2330" text-anchor="start" >4. Draadkleuren motor: gangbare NEMA 17-code,</text>
<text x="770" y="1106" font-family="Inter, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="11.5" font-weight="400" fill="#1d2330" text-anchor="start" >    spoelparen nameten (BLK–GRN, RED–BLU).</text>
<text x="770" y="1124" font-family="Inter, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="11.5" font-weight="400" fill="#1d2330" text-anchor="start" >5. Motorstroom per as instellen via potmeter.</text>
